[68.745207, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ll inspect the input data and available tools first, then create the jq files and verify that the reconstructed command from `jq_args.yaml` produces the \r\nintended report.\r\n\r\n```\r\nls -la /app && echo '--- users.json ---' && cat /app/users.json && echo '--- versions ---' && jq --version && yq --version\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠼\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
