[76.948694, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m2\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[76.949811, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe input is a 500-user array with active, inactive, and pending statuses, and all timestamps use the `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS...Z` structure. I’ll use \r\n`split(\"T\")[0]` for the date portion, `--indent 2` for formatting, and store the full filter and arguments exactly as required.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncat > /app/cmd.sh <<'EOF'\r\njq --indent 2 '[.[] | select(.status == \"active\") | {user_id: .id, username: .username, email: .email, last_login: (.last_login | split(\"T\")[0]), role_count: \r\n(.roles | length), primary_role: (if (.roles | length) > 0 then .roles[0] else null end)}] | sort_by(.username)' /app/users.json > /app/active_users_report.json\r\nEOF\r\ncat > /app/jq_args.yaml <<'EOF'\r\nfilter: '[.[] | select(.status == \"active\") | {user_id: .id, username: .username, email: .email, last_login: (.last_login | split(\"T\")[0]), role_count: (.roles \r\n| length), primary_role: (if (.roles | length) > 0 then .roles[0] else null end)}] | sort_by(.username)'\r\nargs:\r\n  - \"--indent 2\"\r\nEOF\r\nchmod +x /app/cmd.sh\r\necho '--- cmd.sh ---'\r\nc"]
[76.949857, "o", "at /app/cmd.sh\r\necho '--- jq_args.yaml ---'\r\ncat /app/jq_args.yaml\r\necho '--- executing cmd.sh ---'\r\nbash /app/cmd.sh\r\necho \"exit=$?\"\r\nls -l /app/active_users_report.json\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[76.951183, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[77.003807, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[77.004071, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n--- cmd.sh ---\r\njq --indent 2 '[.[] | select(.status == \"active\") | {user_id: .id, username: .username, email: .email, last_login: (.last_login | split(\"T\")[0]), role_count: \r\n(.roles | length), primary_role: (if (.roles | length) > 0 then .roles[0] else null end)}] | sort_by(.username)' /app/users.json > /app/active_users_report.json\r\n--- jq_args.yaml ---\r\nfilter: '[.[] | select(.status == \"active\") | {user_id: .id, username: .username, email: .email, last_login: (.last_login | split(\"T\")[0]), role_count: (.roles \r\n| length), primary_role: (if (.roles | length) > 0 then .roles[0] else null end)}] | sort_by(.username)'\r\nargs:\r\n  - \"--indent 2\"\r\n--- executing cmd.sh ---\r\nexit=0\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 61820 Nov  1 02:55 /app/active_users_report.json\r\n\r\n"]
